{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"ArcaniaBot","id":"810907841329627137","is_bot":1,"username":"ArcaniaBot"},"author_id":"810907841329627137","channel_id":"854432254158831616","content":"**ArcaniaBot** command help *(Maintenance)*\nUse `?help [command]` for more info on a command\n\n__**Commands**__\n> `     cog`: Manage the bot's functionality modules\n> `    help`: Shows this message\n> ` logthis`: \n> ` message`: Add new scheduled message to the bot\n> `     ooc`: Have the bot remind people to keep ooc to ooc\n> `reaction`: Add new emoji reaction to text triggers\n> `  reload`: Reload files with scheduled messages\n> ` restart`: Save state and restart the bot\n> `     run`: Runs direct commands to the bot\n> `shutdown`: Save state and close the bot\n> `  stocks`: Interact with stocks of Empire City companies\n> `   tasks`: Checks the status of automatic tasks\n> `    time`: Show current server time\n> `   where`: Show which channel someone was last active in\n\n*Made by Versil and hosted by Heki for Tales From Arcania season 4*","created_at":"2021-06-21T18:38:51.275000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"856604095388188714","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"854432254158831616","content":"?help reload","created_at":"2021-06-21T18:38:56.416000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"856604116951236608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"ArcaniaBot","id":"810907841329627137","is_bot":1,"username":"ArcaniaBot"},"author_id":"810907841329627137","channel_id":"854432254158831616","content":"?reload\n`?reload (which)`\n\n***Admin-only command***\n\nReload message files, specified by what you pass to it as `which` in the usage above:\n\n- if `which` is any of \"daily\", \"time\", \"hour\" -> the daily messages (defined with just their time)\n- if `which` is any of \"one time\", \"onetime\", \"date\" -> the one-time messages (defined by date and time)\n- if `which` is \"both\" -> both daily and one-time messages\n- if `which` is \"clock\" -> clock messages\n- if `which` is \"all\" -> all three message files\n\nFiles are reloaded automatically every day at defined rollover time (00:00 US/Pacific).","created_at":"2021-06-21T18:38:56.568000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"856604117589032960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
